---
const hv = "'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif";
---

<section id="story" class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20 py-20">

  <!-- Top: two-column layout -->
  <div class="story-top">

    <!-- LEFT: image (~45%) -->
    <div class="story-image-col">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dvfhegxgx/image/upload/v1773211510/story_mjz7ql.png" alt="Fernanda Jara Meza" class="story-img" />
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT: text (~55%) -->
    <div class="story-text-col">
      <h2 class="story-title">
        I've always looked at the world with curiosity.
      </h2>

      <p class="story-para">
        I've always been drawn to small details: gestures, colors, textures, memories. Over time, I realized I needed a way to process everything I observe and feel, and creating became that language. Design gave me structure and clarity; illustration gave me space and freedom. I naturally move between these two ways of thinking: one more analytical and intentional, the other more intuitive and emotional.
      </p>

      <p class="story-para">
        As a designer, I build visual systems with purpose. As an artist, I transform what feels internal into something tangible, something I can share.
      </p>

      <p class="story-para story-para--italic">
        Creating allows me to give form to what I carry inside, and both sides continue to shape how I see the world and how I grow within it.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Experience table -->
  <div class="exp-table">

    <div class="exp-row">
      <span class="exp-role">Graphic designer</span>
      <span class="exp-company">
        <strong>Greater studio</strong>
        <span class="exp-location"> — New York</span>
      </span>
      <span class="exp-years">2025 - 2026</span>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-row">
      <span class="exp-role">Jr. Graphic designer</span>
      <span class="exp-company">
        <strong>APOYO Comunicación</strong>
        <span class="exp-location"> — Perú</span>
      </span>
      <span class="exp-years">2022 - 2024</span>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-row">
      <span class="exp-role">Internship</span>
      <span class="exp-company">
        <strong>Design Agencies</strong>
        <span class="exp-location"> — Perú</span>
      </span>
      <span class="exp-years">2021 - 2022</span>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<style define:vars={{ hv }}>
  /* ── Top two-column ── */
  .story-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .story-top {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 60px;
    }
    .story-image-col { flex: 45; }
    .story-text-col  { flex: 55; }
  }

  .story-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story-title {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 110%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0 0 28px 0;
  }

  .story-para {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 125%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #000000;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }

  .story-para--italic {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── Experience table ── */
  .exp-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 1px solid #E0E0E0;
  }

  .exp-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E0E0E0;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .exp-role {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #000;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .exp-company {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #000;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .exp-company strong {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .exp-location {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #666;
  }

  .exp-years {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #000;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex: 1;
  }
</style>
